# Docker build kontekstidan chetlatiladi (context: repo ildizi — `docker-compose.yml`).
#
# MUHIM: bu fayl bo'lmasa `docker/Dockerfile.web` dagi `COPY frontend/ ./` buyrug'i
# host'dagi `frontend/node_modules`/`dist` papkasini ham nusxalaydi (agar dasturchi
# mashinasida `npm install`/`npm run build` ilgari ishlatilgan bo'lsa) va bu `npm ci`
# o'rnatgan Linux-mos paketlarni (masalan, `@rollup/rollup-darwin-arm64` kabi macOS-ga
# xos "native" ikkilik fayllar bilan) USTIDAN YOZIB, image ichidagi `npm run build`ni
# buzadi. Xato faqat host mashinasida `node_modules` mavjud bo'lgandagina chiqadi —
# aks holda CI kabi toza muhitda sezilmay qolib, keyin production build'da "birdan"
# paydo bo'ladi. Xuddi shu sabab `.NET` uchun ham `bin`/`obj` chetlatiladi.

# .NET
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Frontend
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/
frontend/coverage/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/test-results/
# Lokal Vite muhit fayllari — build-vaqt qiymatlari compose `build.args` orqali beriladi
# (`docker/Dockerfile.web` izohi). `frontend/.env.example` kerak emas, lekin zarari yo'q.
frontend/.env
frontend/.env.*

# Versiya nazorati va IDE
.git/
.vs/
.vscode/

# Hujjatlar va vaqtinchalik — image'ga kerak emas
docs/
prompts/
*.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.srm_bundle.json
backups/
